#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:2 28a3618e9a174176845ba27c7aa6df1f
msgid "_`Torque below base speed`"
msgstr ""
"_`基速以下转矩`"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:4 e77a41de681445eba00d31179eb0d947
msgid ""
"The task: from a torque request, produce a dq current reference this "
"machine can actually deliver, and drive both current axes to it inside "
"the voltage the modulator has. This is the slice every other slice stands"
" on -- the field weakening of slice S4 answers the same question above "
"base speed, and the observer of slice S1 exists so that the angle this "
"slice assumes is available without a sensor."
msgstr ""
"任务：从一个转矩请求出发，给出这台电机实际能交付的 dq 电流参考，并在调制"
"器所给的电压之内把两个电流轴都驱动到它。这是其他所有切片都站在其上的切片"
"——切片 S4 的弱磁在基速以上回答同一个问题，切片 S1 的观测器之所以存在，是"
"为了让本切片所假设的角度不需要传感器就能得到。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:12 f417e9329fcc4bf4bcd7af31e7157fbc
msgid "What you need"
msgstr ""
"所需部件"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:14 2ca956546df64b89987d1c3fe0599e32
msgid ""
"``foc/core/reference.hpp`` -- the reference policy. ``MtpaReference`` for"
" a salient machine; the default ``d = 0`` generator for a surface one."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/reference.hpp`` ——参考策略。凸极电机用 ``MtpaReference`` ；表"
"贴式电机用默认的 ``d = 0`` 发生器。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:16 bfa07f985e2d494880eb24e24e3eaf28
msgid ""
"``foc/core/pi.hpp`` -- one controller per axis. Two instances, not one "
"shared: the integral state is per axis."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/pi.hpp`` ——每个轴一个控制器。两个实例，不是一个共用：积分状态"
"是按轴的。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:18 d062f24974bd40d28c33a7d0dd5bcb67
msgid ""
"``foc/core/feedforward.hpp`` -- the axis cross-coupling and back-EMF "
"terms, added **after** the PI so the PI keeps its own-axis job."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/feedforward.hpp`` ——轴间交叉耦合与反电动势项，在 PI **之后** "
"相加，使 PI 只管本轴的事。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:20 1adfccb4f3a54e0eb9b9e86031b77ca3
msgid ""
"``foc/core/limits.hpp`` -- ``clamp``, and the ceiling itself. The ceiling"
" is not the rail voltage: it is the modulator's linear range, which slice"
" S5 covers."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/limits.hpp`` —— ``clamp`` ，以及上限本身。这个上限不是母线电"
"压，而是调制器的线性区，切片 S5 覆盖它。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:25 8231f6ef28eb47149044d8597190e505
msgid "A minimal program"
msgstr ""
"最小程序"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:27 55a5ec3c21a2466bbd336d0038451c8c
msgid ""
"``docs/doxygen/dox/demos/slice-s3-torque.cxx`` is the whole of it, "
"compiled with the flags this repository's ``strict`` gate uses. It names "
"one salient machine once and asks two reference policies the same q "
"command:"
msgstr ""
"``docs/doxygen/dox/demos/slice-s3-torque.cxx`` 就是全部，用本仓库 ``"
"strict`` 门禁所用的选项编译。它只声明一台凸极电机一次，用同一个 q 指令去"
"问两种参考策略："

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:37 6f4ecbe7fde94f0f9c65c92cb8f6e757
msgid "Two rows of that output are worth reading before the rest:"
msgstr ""
"那份输出里有两行值得先于其余各行读："

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:39 f5b3260b81fd4a0585fc855945a94beb
msgid ""
"on the machine as shipped (``i_d_per_speed_a_s_per_rad`` left at zero) "
"the MTPA policy answers **exactly** what the ``d = 0`` policy answers. "
"That is not a bug and not a coincidence: the field's default refuses d "
"current, because a d current is only safe once somebody has stated how "
"the angle is measured."
msgstr ""
"在出厂状态的电机上（ ``i_d_per_speed_a_s_per_rad`` 留在零）MTPA 策略给出"
"的答案与 ``d = 0`` 策略 **完全** 相同。这既不是缺陷，也不是巧合：该字段"
"的默认值拒绝 d 电流，因为只有在有人说明了角度如何测量之后，d 电流才是安"
"全的。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:43 e9cdbf29220846d8b924f520e2ce70be
msgid ""
"at the top of the sweep the q answer is slightly below the request, "
"because the request does not fit ``|i| <= i_max`` and the policy walks "
"**down the MTPA curve** instead of scaling both components. Scaling both "
"would leave the curve and lose more torque than necessary."
msgstr ""
"在扫描的顶端，q 的答案略低于请求，因为该请求装不进 ``|i| <= i_max`` ，策"
"略便沿 **MTPA 曲线往下走** ，而不是把两个分量一起缩放。一起缩放会离开曲"
"线，损失比必要的更多转矩。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:49 07533ed2b6424110a9e6b48fb2e3e1b7
msgid "Where the numbers come from"
msgstr ""
"数字的来源"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:51 a4c20b9556374575964172977815a529
msgid ""
"Every gain in the example is derived from the nameplate, not tuned: ``kp "
"= L * omega`` and ``ki = R * omega`` are the pole-zero cancellation, and "
"the same numbers come out of ``foc::current_pi_config(motor_config, "
"bandwidth, v_bus)``, which is what the C path, the SIL bench and a board "
"should all call rather than retype. The feedforward terms are built from "
"the same nameplate through ``foc::feedforward_config(motor_config)``."
msgstr ""
"示例里的每个增益都从铭牌推出，不是调出来的： ``kp = L * omega`` 与 ``ki"
"=R * omega`` 就是零极点对消，同样的数字也能从 ``foc::current_pi_config("
"motor_config, bandwidth, v_bus)`` 得到，C 路径、SIL 台架和板子都应当调用"
"它，而不是重抄。前馈项通过 ``foc::feedforward_config(motor_config)`` 从"
"同一份铭牌构造。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:58 59083a974f6a4721b5b18916d94ebd9a
msgid ""
"The one field that has no nameplate source is "
"``i_d_per_speed_a_s_per_rad``. It is a statement about **how the angle is"
" measured**, so it cannot be derived; the field's own documentation "
"carries the measured numbers for the nominal machine and says which "
"values are safe with and without a position sensor."
msgstr ""
"唯一没有铭牌来源的字段是 ``i_d_per_speed_a_s_per_rad`` 。它是关于 **角度"
"如何测量** 的陈述，因此无法推导；该字段自己的文档载有标称电机的实测数字"
"，并说明在有、无位置传感器时哪些值安全。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:64 33051d98ba3140cb8af5b847d723e71c
msgid "How it goes wrong"
msgstr ""
"失效方式"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:66 00def0e7ef314599b7e18a280326b5af
msgid ""
"**MTPA that silently equals d = 0.** Leave the d-current allowance at its"
" default and everything compiles, runs, and produces the surface-machine "
"answer on an interior machine. The library cannot warn: it has no way to "
"know whether the zero is a decision or an omission. This is why the "
"allowance is an explicit field rather than a derived one."
msgstr ""
"**MTPA 悄悄等于 d = 0。** 把 d 电流额度留在默认值，一切都能编译、能运行"
"，并在一台内置式电机上给出表贴式电机的答案。库无法告警：它无从知道这个零"
"是一个决定还是一处遗漏。这就是为什么该额度是一个显式字段，而不是推导出来"
"的。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:71 7001835ed80a465d97094332d27508fb
msgid ""
"**The ceiling inside the PI.** Clamping the PI output to the linear range"
" and then adding feedforward can exceed what the modulator can deliver, "
"and the clamp that was supposed to stop the integral from winding up no "
"longer describes the voltage being applied. Clamp the sum."
msgstr ""
"**上限加在 PI 里面。** 把 PI 输出限到线性区、然后再加上前馈，可能超过调"
"制器能交付的量；那个本应阻止积分饱和的限幅，也不再描述实际施加的电压。要"
"限的是和。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:75 757e31c7ec9e4e83b7e468abcba3b91f
msgid ""
"**Feedforward on the reference instead of the measurement.** The terms "
"are ``omega * L * i`` and ``omega * psi_f``; with the reference in place "
"of the measured current the term stops responding when the loop is "
"saturated, which is exactly when it matters."
msgstr ""
"**前馈取参考而不是取测量值。** 两项分别是 ``omega * L * i`` 和 ``omega *"
"psi_f`` ；用参考代替实测电流，该项在环饱和时就失去响应，而那正是它最有用"
"的时刻。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:79 de612c75ccfb41e0b617467cbb738b02
msgid ""
"**A d-axis reference the current limit cannot honour.** The policy walks "
"down the curve for this reason; a hand-written ``i_d`` that ignores the "
"limit produces a pair whose magnitude exceeds ``i_max`` and the loop then"
" chases a reference the hardware will never reach."
msgstr ""
"**电流限制无法兑现的 d 轴参考。** 策略正因如此才沿曲线往下走；手写一个忽"
"略限制的 ``i_d`` ，产生的电流对幅值超过 ``i_max`` ，环随后去追一个硬件永"
"远到不了的参考。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:85 63ef214010a8416d9d76808156d613fa
msgid "Evidence"
msgstr ""
"证据"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:87 c8592533883c42daa5e847b796582908
msgid ""
"Four claim rows cover this slice, one per piece: "
"``foc/core/reference.hpp``, ``foc/core/limits.hpp``, ``foc/core/pi.hpp`` "
"and ``foc/core/feedforward.hpp``. The level this slice may state is the "
"**minimum** of those four, and the level itself is read from the claim "
"table in the project ``README.md`` rather than written here -- a number "
"copied into a page is a second source of truth with a shelf life."
msgstr ""
"四条主张行覆盖本切片，每个部件一条： ``foc/core/reference.hpp`` 、 ``"
"foc/core/limits.hpp`` 、 ``foc/core/pi.hpp`` 和 ``"
"foc/core/feedforward.hpp`` 。本切片可以陈述的等级是这四条中的 **最小值**"
" ，而等级本身从项目 ``README.md`` 的主张表读取，而不是写在这里——抄进页面"
"的数字是第二个事实来源，且有保质期。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:94 b683f0a099df45cbabad150a73e3cbc2
msgid ""
"Not claimed by this slice: the torque the loop produces. A torque figure "
"needs a machine model, which is the SIL bench's job and carries its own "
"claim rows. This page stops at the current reference and the voltage "
"command, which is where the library stops too."
msgstr ""
"本切片不主张：环所产生的转矩。一个转矩数字需要电机模型，那是 SIL 台架的"
"事，并且有自己的主张行。本页止于电流参考和电压指令，库也在那里止步。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:100 2daab6e83f334be8835ae08d966bcc10
msgid "Figure"
msgstr ""
"图"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:107 1af63b87df5b4e70806dfdaced820cc8
msgid ""
"the current loop this slice builds, driven by the SIL bench: iq follows a"
" 1 A step in both directions, id is held near zero by the d-axis "
"controller"
msgstr ""
"本切片搭出的电流环，由 SIL 台架驱动：iq 在两个方向上跟随 1 A 的阶跃，id"
"由 d 轴控制器保持在零附近"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s3-torque.rst:110 49b3b4dfff3e4a08a0f17733f669ed23
msgid ""
"The figure is produced by ``docs/demos/make_figures.py`` from the SIL "
"bench, not drawn by hand. It shows the loop closing; it does not show "
"MTPA, because the bench machine is surface-mounted and on that machine "
"the MTPA answer is the ``d = 0`` answer. The MTPA difference is what the "
"program on this page prints."
msgstr ""
"图由 ``docs/demos/make_figures.py`` 从 SIL 台架生成，不是手绘。它展示环"
"闭合；它不展示 MTPA，因为台架电机是表贴式，而在那台电机上 MTPA 的答案就"
"是 ``d = 0`` 的答案。MTPA 的差别是本页那个程序打印出来的东西。"

